  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Owned by lettucectl, not Compose",
      "items": [
        "The image, the volume and each stack's internal network are made by lettucectl; compose/doc-tools.yml declares the volume and network external, so down -v never removes them",
        "sync_doc_tools starts the shared Gotenberg (Compose project lettuce_shared), connects it with the alias gotenberg to every complete stack's internal, labelled network, and deletes stale networks and volumes",
        "mcp adds office and pdf to Settings -> MCP once per stack (DOC_TOOLS_MCP_REGISTERED), then restarts the BFF so the mcp-servers skill names them"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Guarded by lettucectl check",
      "items": [
        "Only the app-server mounts the tools' volume, read-only at /opt/lettuce-doc-tools, and only it joins the doc-tools network, keeping its default network",
        "The doc-tools network must be internal and labelled for this stack",
        "Gotenberg: hardened, non-root, no ports, no mounts, internal networks only, and every flag that stops a document fetching URLs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not a boundary",
      "items": [
        "The servers' workspace jail stops mistakes, not agents: agents are root in the same container",
        "Gotenberg is the one container on every stack's doc-tools network"
      ]
    }
  ]
